<title>USA: FTC lawyer sees no Staples/Office Depot settlement.</title>
<headline>FTC lawyer sees no Staples/Office Depot settlement.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The top lawyer for the Federal Trade Commission said Friday that he sees no way that a settlement can be reached in the future for a merger of Office Depot Inc and Staples Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;Standing here today in good faith, I don't see a settlement that will solve the problem posed by this merger,&quot; William Baer, chief of the FTC bureau of competition, said at a news conference.</p>
<p>Commissioners may not comment after voting, so Baer said he was unable to speak for them.</p>
</text>
